  'dl.howTitle': 'How it works', 'dl.howSub': 'Four steps from idea to bragging rights.',
  'dl.step.club.title': 'Create your club', 'dl.step.club.text': 'Name, colours, crest and formation. Invite friends with a code or a link – or fill up with AI clubs.',
  'dl.step.draft.title': 'Draft live', 'dl.step.draft.text': 'Snake draft: the order reverses every round. 11 starters that fit your formation and 5 substitutes.',
  'dl.step.season.title': 'Play the season', 'dl.step.season.text': 'All matches are played today, one round at a time. Watch them live in 2D, change tactics and make substitutions.',
  'dl.step.again.title': 'Draft again', 'dl.step.again.text': 'See the final table and stats. Last place picks first in the next draft – and you can keep up to 3 players.',
  'dl.funTitle': 'Why it is fun', 'dl.funSub': 'A football manager stripped down to the good bits – and turned into a party game.',
  'dl.f.clock.title': '60 seconds on the clock', 'dl.f.clock.text': 'The pressure is real. Hesitate, and the assistant picks for you.',
  'dl.f.snake.title': 'Snake draft', 'dl.f.snake.text': 'Pick last in round one, first in round two. Everyone gets a fair shot at the stars.',
  'dl.f.wish.title': 'Wishlist', 'dl.f.wish.text': 'Build your shortlist while you wait in the lobby. Run out of time, and your list decides.',
  'dl.f.assistant.title': 'The assistant', 'dl.f.assistant.text': 'Suggests the best available player for your weakest spot – one click and he is yours.',
  'dl.f.voice.title': 'Chat and voice chat', 'dl.f.voice.text': 'Celebrate, complain and trash-talk while you draft. You can see who is talking.',
  'dl.f.ai.title': 'AI clubs', 'dl.f.ai.text': 'Only two of you? Fill the league with AI clubs that draft and play on their own.',
  'dl.f.keepers.title': 'Keepers', 'dl.f.keepers.text': 'Keep 0–3 players from last season. Build a dynasty – or start over every year.',
  'dl.f.playoff.title': 'Playoffs', 'dl.f.playoff.text': 'Finish the season with a final or semi-finals. Single matches, extra time and penalties.',
  'dl.f.today.title': 'Everything today', 'dl.f.today.text': 'No dates, no fatigue that lingers. Play a whole season in one evening.',
  'dl.f.finale.title': 'Season finale', 'dl.f.finale.text': 'Champions, top scorers, assists and best ratings – plus an all-time table across seasons.',
  'dl.f.crest.title': 'Your own crest', 'dl.f.crest.text': 'Pick shape and colours. The game wears your club colours throughout.',
  'dl.f.fair.title': 'Fair for everyone', 'dl.f.fair.text': 'No chemistry, morale or money. Only your picks and your tactics decide.',
  'dl.shotsTitle': 'See it in action', 'dl.shotsSub': 'From lobby to champions – all in the browser.',
  'dl.shot.lobby': 'The lobby', 'dl.shot.lobby.text': 'Create your club, invite friends and chat while you wait.', 'dl.shot.live': 'The live draft', 'dl.shot.live.text': 'The clock, the pool, your pitch and the draft board.', 'dl.shot.summary': 'The finale', 'dl.shot.summary.text': 'The final table and the season\'s best – then on to the next draft.',
  'dl.finalTitle': 'Who has the best eye for a player?', 'dl.finalText': 'Create a league, send the link to your friends and find out tonight.',
  'land.promoPill': 'New game mode', 'land.promoTitle': 'Draft League: draft your dream team with friends', 'land.promoText': 'Build a fictional club from the 500 best players – live, with 60 seconds per pick and voice chat. Then play a whole season against each other in one evening.', 'land.promoCta': 'Read about the Draft League',
  'dr.grade.A+.1': 'This is not a draft, it is a robbery. Everyone else might as well play for second place.', 'dr.grade.A+.2': 'The expert has run out of superlatives. Built by someone who has watched FAR too much football.', 'dr.grade.A+.3': 'The favourites. If they do not win, blame the manager – not the draft.',
  'dr.grade.A.1': 'A strong draft with very few weak spots. The rest of the league should be nervous.', 'dr.grade.A.2': 'Classic, solid and dangerous. One of the few who actually had a plan.', 'dr.grade.A.3': 'Top class all the way through. Only the bench separates them from an A+.',
  'dr.grade.B+.1': 'Good work. A couple of picks the expert frowns at, but the whole holds up.', 'dr.grade.B+.2': 'Above average with room for surprises. Underestimate them at your own risk.', 'dr.grade.B+.3': 'The stars are there – now the tactics just need to follow.',
  'dr.grade.B.1': 'Neither hot nor not. The team you forget about until they steal points off you.', 'dr.grade.B.2': 'Middle of the pack. The season will be decided by tactics, not by the draft.', 'dr.grade.B.3': 'Solid craftsmanship without any grand gestures.',
  'dr.grade.C.1': 'The expert scratched their head several times along the way. There are holes.', 'dr.grade.C.2': 'Some good names, but also picks that sent the chat into meltdown.', 'dr.grade.C.3': 'It could work – if everything falls into place. It rarely does.',
  'dr.grade.D.1': 'Was this a draft or a wheel of fortune? The expert is worried.', 'dr.grade.D.2': 'Early picks that should have been taken much later. Or not at all.', 'dr.grade.D.3': 'The underdogs. On the bright side, they can only surprise.',
  'dr.grade.F.1': 'The expert has closed their eyes and pulled the plug. Good luck.', 'dr.grade.F.2': 'Was the assistant on holiday? This needs a miracle.', 'dr.grade.F.3': 'Historically bad. But nothing in the rules says you cannot win anyway.',
