  'will.complain.renewal': "{player} does not want to extend his contract", 'will.complain.renewal.body': "His contract expires in the summer, and he would like to talk to you about the future. Answer him from his profile.", 'complaint.says.renewal.ambition.refuses': "Boss, I'll be honest: I have ambitions, and bigger clubs are showing interest. I'm not extending – I want to move on.", 'complaint.says.renewal.ambition.hesitant': "I'm happy here, but I'm not sure where the club is heading. Convince me we can win something.", 'complaint.says.renewal.time.refuses': "I'm not playing enough. I won't extend to sit on the bench – in the summer I'll find a club where I play.", 'complaint.says.renewal.time.hesitant': "I'd like to stay, but only if I get a bigger role. Can you promise me that?", 'complaint.says.renewal.money.refuses': "I'm underpaid for what I mean to the team. I won't extend on that wage.", 'complaint.says.renewal.money.hesitant': "I want to extend, but the wage must reflect my value to the team.", 'complaint.opt.renewal.promise.ambition': "We're building a team to win things", 'complaint.opt.renewal.promise.time': "You'll get a bigger role", 'complaint.opt.renewal.promise.money': "You'll get a wage to match", 'complaint.hint.renewal.promise.ambition': "Works if the club is big enough or the team is near the top", 'complaint.hint.renewal.promise.time': "He expects to play in the coming weeks", 'complaint.hint.renewal.promise.money': "He'll negotiate – but wants a higher wage", 'complaint.opt.renewal.listen': "I respect your decision", 'complaint.hint.renewal.listen': "A hesitant player may be persuaded later", 'complaint.opt.renewal.fight': "You're under contract and play for us until summer", 'complaint.hint.renewal.fight': "Professionals accept it – others get upset", 'complaint.opt.renewal.list': "Then we'll sell you so the club gets something", 'complaint.hint.renewal.list': "He is transfer listed – better than losing him for free", 'complaint.r.renewal.time': "I'll hold you to that. If I get to play, I'll happily sign.", 'complaint.r.renewal.money': "Okay, then let's talk. But the wage has to be right.", 'complaint.r.renewal.ambitionOk': "I believe that. Let's talk about a new contract.", 'complaint.r.renewal.ambitionNo': "With respect, boss – I've heard that before. I'm not staying.", 'complaint.r.renewal.listenOk': "Thanks for listening. Maybe we can find a solution after all.", 'complaint.r.renewal.listen': "Thanks for understanding. I'll give everything while I'm here.", 'complaint.r.renewal.fightPro': "Of course. I'll give everything for the club until the last game.", 'complaint.r.renewal.fightBad': "Fine. Then we know where we stand.", 'complaint.r.renewal.list': "That's fair. Thanks for being honest.", 'renewal.status.refuses': "{player} has said he will not extend his contract.", 'renewal.status.hesitant': "{player} is hesitant to extend – he wants more to sign.", 'renewal.status.convinced': "{player} is open to extending.",
