  'trophy.board.league': "The board salutes {manager}: {club} are champions!", 'trophy.board.league.body': "The chairman: “This is a historic day for {club}. {manager} has given us what we dreamed of – a title. The board is 100% behind you, and we are already looking forward to next season.”", 'trophy.board.leagueAgain': "The board: {manager} does it again – title no. {n}!", 'trophy.board.leagueAgain.body': "The chairman: “Winning once is big. Doing it again and again is an era. Thank you, {manager} – you have made {club} a dynasty.”", 'trophy.board.cup': "The board congratulates you on the {comp}!", 'trophy.board.cup.body': "The chairman: “A trophy in the cabinet – this is exactly the kind of night we do it for. Congratulations to {manager} and the whole squad.”", 'trophy.board.cupAgain': "The board: the {comp} again – title no. {n} under {manager}!", 'trophy.board.cupAgain.body': "The chairman: “It is becoming a habit, and a good one. Congratulations, {manager}.”", 'trophy.board.europe': "European triumph! The board is ecstatic about the {comp}", 'trophy.board.europe.body': "The chairman: “{club} have won the {comp}. It is the greatest night in the club's modern history. {manager}, your name is in the club's history books forever.”", 'trophy.board.europeAgain': "The board: the {comp} again – {manager} is a legend!", 'trophy.board.europeAgain.body': "The chairman: “Title no. {n} in the {comp}. There are no words. Thank you.”", 'trophy.fans.league': "The city goes wild – thousands of fans celebrate the title", 'trophy.fans.league.body': "The streets are full of {club} shirts, flags and fireworks. On the fan forum there is only one chant: “{manager}, {manager}, {manager}!”", 'trophy.fans.cup': "The fans celebrate the {comp} win all night", 'trophy.fans.cup.body': "The stands kept singing long after the final whistle, and the bus with the trophy was met by cheering fans outside the stadium.", 'trophy.fans.europe': "The whole country celebrates {club}'s European triumph", 'trophy.fans.europe.body': "Tens of thousands of fans welcomed the team at the airport. “We will never forget this,” they say everywhere.", 'trophy.captain.league': "{player}: “This is for you and the fans, boss”", 'trophy.captain.league.body': "The captain: “You made us believe from day one. Everyone in the dressing room would run through a wall for you. Thank you, boss.”", 'trophy.captain.cup': "{player}: “You gave us belief in the final”", 'trophy.captain.cup.body': "The captain: “The team talk before the game was spot on. We wanted to win this for you.”", 'trophy.captain.europe': "{player}: “The greatest night of my life – thank you, boss”", 'trophy.captain.europe.body': "The captain: “As a boy I dreamed of lifting this trophy. You made it possible.”", 'trophy.press.league': "The paper: {manager} – the architect of {club}'s title", 'trophy.press.league.body': "The pundits agree: the tactics, the signings and the ability to get the best out of the squad made the difference. {manager} is already tipped as manager of the year.", 'trophy.press.cup': "The paper: {manager} delivers silverware to {club}", 'trophy.press.cup.body': "Cup competitions are fickle, but {club} had an answer for everything. A deserved title for {manager}.", 'trophy.press.europe': "Europe salutes {manager}", 'trophy.press.europe.body': "Media all over Europe write about {club}'s triumph in the {comp}. {manager}'s name is suddenly on everyone's lips – including at the biggest clubs.", 'fan.ev.trophy': "Trophy!",
  'reject.reason.future': "\"You're the future – we're building the team around you for years to come\"", 'reject.r.future.2': "{player}: Wow, thanks boss. That means everything to me. I'll stay and prove you right.", 'reject.r.future.1': "{player}: Nice to hear. But then I want my chance on the pitch too.", 'reject.r.future.0': "{player}: The future? I don't quite believe that – I can see who's playing.", 'reject.r.future.1Calm': "{player}: Thanks, boss. I wasn't in a hurry to join {club} anyway.", 'reject.r.future.0Calm': "{player}: Okay… I wasn't that interested in {club} anyway.",
