  "press.q.cleanSheets": "Three clean sheets in a row. What is the secret behind the defence?",
  "press.q.leakyDefence": "You have conceded {ga} goals in the last four games. What is going wrong at the back?",
  "press.q.scoringSpree": "{gf} goals in the last three games – is this the best attacking form you have seen?",
  "press.q.goalsDrought": "No goals in the last two games. Where will the goals come from?",
