  "press.q.jobLinked": "You are being linked with other jobs. Are you staying at the club?",
  "press.q.seasonStart": "The season starts now. What is the aim this year?",
  "press.q.midtable": "There is not much left to play for. How do you keep the players sharp?",
  "press.q.promotionRace": "You are in the promotion race. Can you hold your nerve?",
  "press.q.banned": "{player} is suspended. Who takes his place?",
  "press.q.philosophyDef": "Your play has been called boring and defensive. Is that fair?",
  "press.q.philosophyAtt": "You play very attacking football – isn't that risky at the back?",
  "press.q.pressing": "Your high press has become your trademark. Can the players keep it up?",
  "press.q.longBall": "A lot of long balls from you – is that deliberate?",
  "press.q.fatigue": "The players look tired. Is there enough energy for the game?",
  "press.q.dressingRoom": "There are rumours of a bad atmosphere in the dressing room. Is it true?",
  "press.q.dressingGood": "The squad seem to be in great spirits together. What have you done?",
  "press.a.form.team": "The team has found its rhythm – and we are not stopping here.",
  "press.a.form.humble": "We take one game at a time. Form comes and goes.",
  "press.a.form.fire": "I demand more – nobody rests on their laurels in my squad!",
  "press.a.form.skip": "I would rather talk about the game than statistics.",
  "press.a.opponent.win": "We are going for the win, and the players know it.",
  "press.a.opponent.respect": "We have great respect for them, but we are ready.",
  "press.a.opponent.nothing": "Paper doesn't play football. We will show it on the pitch.",
  "press.a.opponent.skip": "Ask me after the game.",
  "press.a.bigMatch.love": "These are the games you become a footballer for.",
  "press.a.bigMatch.normal": "It is three points like any other game.",
  "press.a.bigMatch.war": "It will be war – and we won't give an inch.",
  "press.a.bigMatch.skip": "I haven't thought much about it.",
  "press.a.starPlayer.praise": "He is world class right now. He deserves every bit of praise.",
  "press.a.starPlayer.more": "He is good, but he can still get better.",
  "press.a.starPlayer.team": "It is about the team – he gets help from ten others.",
  "press.a.starPlayer.skip": "I don't single out individuals.",
  "press.a.slump.back": "He has my full trust. He will find his form again.",
  "press.a.slump.demand": "He knows it isn't good enough. Now he has to deliver.",
  "press.a.slump.bench": "Nobody has a guaranteed place – not even him.",
  "press.a.slump.skip": "I won't discuss that in public.",
  "press.a.injury.blow": "It is a big loss, but we have a deep squad.",
  "press.a.injury.chance": "Now others get the chance to show what they can do.",
  "press.a.injury.back": "We can't wait to get him back – he is missed.",
  "press.a.injury.skip": "I don't comment on injuries.",
  "press.a.board.trust": "I have the board's trust and full focus on the job.",
  "press.a.board.results": "Results do the talking. We have to deliver them.",
  "press.a.board.angry": "I don't waste time on rumours from people without insight.",
  "press.a.board.skip": "Ask the board.",
