  "press.a.unsettled.talk": "We have talked, and we agree on the way forward.",
  "press.a.unsettled.skip": "That is between me and the player.",
  "press.a.result.proud": "I am proud of the team today – they gave everything.",
  "press.a.result.learn": "There is a lot to learn from that game. We will go home and analyse.",
  "press.a.result.angry": "It wasn't good enough, and the players know it.",
  "press.a.result.skip": "I haven't watched the game back yet.",
