  "press.a.heavyLoss.mine": "I take full responsibility. It is my team.",
  "press.a.heavyLoss.forget": "Days like that happen. We will bounce back.",
  "press.a.heavyLoss.skip": "No comment today.",
  "press.a.redCard.defend": "He is not a dirty player. It was unfortunate.",
