  "press.a.fans.need": "We need them now – more than ever.",
  "press.a.fans.angry": "They are entitled to their opinion, but they must back the team.",
  "press.a.fans.skip": "I focus on the team.",
  "press.a.rumour.stay": "He is not for sale. Full stop.",
  "press.a.rumour.price": "Everyone has a price – but his is very high.",
