  "press.a.rumour.skip": "I don't comment on rumours.",
  "press.a.drought.back": "The goals will come. I see a confident striker in training.",
  "press.a.drought.demand": "A striker is judged on goals. They have to come now.",
  "press.a.drought.work": "He works for the team, and that shouldn't be underestimated.",
  "press.a.drought.skip": "It is not about one player.",
  "press.a.cleanSheets.unit": "The whole team defends – from the strikers back.",
